herit;"><font style=3D"vertical-align: inherit;">Summarize</font></font></h=
3>=20
<p><font style=3D"vertical-align: inherit;"><font style=3D"vertical-align: =
inherit;">Although a series of testing process looks a bit cumbersome, it h=
elps us reduce interference factors. If there is an outbound problem, we ca=
n quickly locate the cause, solve the problem, and achieve the results we w=
ant.</font></font></p>=20
<h2><a name=3D"t13"></a><a id=3D"_47"></a><font style=3D"vertical-align: in=
herit;"><font style=3D"vertical-align: inherit;">Precautions</font></font><=
/h2>=20
<h3><a name=3D"t14"></a><a id=3D"1LVDS_link_48"></a><font style=3D"vertical=
-align: inherit;"><font style=3D"vertical-align: inherit;">1. Adjust the LV=
DS link parity field</font></font></h3>=20
<p><font style=3D"vertical-align: inherit;"><font style=3D"vertical-align: =
inherit;">The GM8775C driver display found that the overall picture display=
 is OK, but found some strange jagged pixels on the edge, this is because t=
he EVEN / ODD of the GM8775C LVDS LINK0 / LINK1 is wrongly configured, just=
 reconfigure the LINK EVEN / ODD and then copy it again Generate the applic=
ation, compile and run on OK.</font></font><br> <img src=3D"https://img-blo=
g.csdnimg.cn/20210617211255983.jpg?x-oss-process=3Dimage/watermark,type_ZmF=
